    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "CANADA\n68 Marta\nRede man fans\nCrejepio\nгруа\nRof lo\nOcean\nOcean\nService\nof disp\nGrancos\nLaveloricas",
      "Cocktails\nUNITED'S VERY DRY BEEFEATER MARTINI\nUNITED'S VERY DRY SMIRNOFF VODKA MARTINI\nMANHATTAN\nBLOODY MARY\nWHISKEY SOUR\nDRY SACK SHERRY\nDOMESTIC BEER\nSpirits\nOLD FORESTER BOURBON\nCUTTY SARK SCOTCH\nDEWAR'S WHITE LABEL SCOTCH\nCANADIAN CLUB\nJACK DANIELS TENNESSEE WHISKEY\nBEEFEATER GIN\nBACARDI RUM\nCHRISTIAN BROTHERS BRANDY\nWines\nA SPECIALLY SELECTED CALIFORNIA RED AND WHITE WINE\nLiqueurs\nBENEDICTINE AND BRANDY\nCREME DE MENTHE\nCOURVOISIER COGNAC VSOP\nGRAND MARNIER\nKARLA\nAMARETTO di SARONNO\nCoca-Cola\nSOFT BEVERAGES\nAlcoholic beverages are available for purchase.\nMinors cannot be Served Alcohol.\nCOCKTAIL COMPANION\nTo welcome you aboard and accompany the beverage of your choice, we hope you will enjoy this\nvariety of snacks and uniquely designed package including your own Ocean to Ocean luggage\ntag or deck of playing cards.\nTOSSED GREEN SALAD\nA crisp assortment of greens served with tomato and a specially prepared dressing.\nYour Choice of\nOLD-FASHIONED POT ROAST OF BEEF\nBottom round steaks are braised with onions, carrots and celery, then simmered with tomato puree.\nservea wun a rea wine sauce, buttered egg noodles ana mixea vegetables.\nOCEAN TO OCEAN SPECIALTY\nCALIFORNIA SEAFOOD STEW\nFisherman's Wharf in San Francisco serves a popular seafood dish which combines tomato-garlic\nsauce with seafood. Our version features shrimp, scallops, clams and cod.\nOUR LIGHTER AIR FARE\nVEGETABLE ROYAL\nBroccoli spears, mushrooms, sliced carrots and zucchini, topped with cheese sauce and served\nwith rontony\nROLL with BUTTER\nAPPLE PIE\nBeverages\nMaxwell House Coffee\nTEA\nMILK\nThis menu prepared in United Airlines Flight Kitchen\nat San Francisco, John Wolfsheimer,\nExecutive Chef.\nMember, American Culinary Federation;\nChefs Association of the Pacific Coast\nChevalier de la Chaine des Rotisseurs.\nPlease accept our apology if, due to previous passenger\nselections, your choice is not avalable.\nL D2-1"
    ],
